LICENSE PLACEHOLDER — no license granted yet
============================================

Status (17 Aug 2026): this repository intentionally ships WITHOUT a
LICENSE file. Until one exists, the default applies: ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.
No permission is granted to use, copy, modify, or redistribute this work.

Intended license
----------------
MIT — consistent with the ESPHome / Home Assistant ecosystem, and the
project's goal of maximum reuse ("any meter, any country, any vehicle").

What blocks it
--------------
The project's Neurio/Generac Modbus emulation derives, in part, from prior
art whose licensing must be settled first:

1. PVi1/esphome-twc-control (https://github.com/PVi1/esphome-twc-control).
   Verified 14 Aug 2026: that repository displays NO explicit license
   (no LICENSE file, no sidebar mention) — which legally defaults to
   "all rights reserved". The derived/inspired portions here are the idea
   of emulating the Neurio in ESPHome, the Modbus register structure
   (0x88–0x92 / 0xF4–0xFC, the Generac handshake), and the escalation
   technique. ==> An explicit agreement from the author is REQUIRED
   before this project can be published under any license.

2. LucaTNT's public gist (Neurio identity register constants):
   https://gist.github.com/LucaTNT/4adf01a7252386559070023612efa117
   ==> Credit required; license status to confirm alongside (1).

The majority of the code and all of the documentation corpus are original
to this project (RAW publication semantics, bias/ramp lever, encrypted
multi-source UDP link and fail-safe, the entire measured control law) and
carry no third-party constraint — but the project licenses as a whole, so
nothing ships until (1) is resolved.

Release checklist (replaces this file)
--------------------------------------
[ ] Written agreement from PVi1 covering the derived portions
    (attribution terms, compatible license).
[ ] LucaTNT credit terms confirmed.
[ ] LICENSE file added (MIT unless the agreement dictates otherwise);
    attribution notices finalised in README and docs.
[ ] Delete this placeholder.

Until every box is checked: repository stays PRIVATE, no publication, no
redistribution. (See also ARCHITECTURE.md D4: version stays 0.x until the
agreement is settled and one external installation validates.)
